                      # at epoch 10 while the loss fell to 0.6119 — the converge-and-overfit shape this
                      # recipe produces, so the peak is not a truncation artefact. It sits 0.0042 under
                      # the 0.8459 seat bar and 0.0223 under the 0.8640 roster bar, so it seats nowhere
                      # on merit. IT IS STILL DOING WORK, and that is why the checkpoint is kept: it is
