                      # seven to eight times the 0.0062 noise floor. That is not a seat question and it is
                      # not a diversity question either: a member half a point of AUC under every other
                      # entry on its own recipe brings its errors, not its independence, and the seat bar
                      # is 0.8459. What the run BUYS is the trunk-family reading it was armed for — a
                      # segmentation-pretrained (SAM) trunk transferred to a classification stack loses to
                      # both a natural-image trunk and a domain-pretrained one, on a matched recipe.
                      # RE-OPEN BY: a MedSAM arm that changes the transfer, not the seed — the promptable
