                      # -0.0000], and its BEST available seat (replacing mae_matched_s2026) is also
                      # negative at -0.0005. A member whose best case is negative has no seat to find.
                      # WHAT IT ANSWERED. The ledger's standing open question was Kimi's transfer of the
                      # public frontier: "if you add heterogeneity, add exactly one non-DINO member".
                      # Every scoreable member this project owns is a DINOv2/DINOv3 recipe; the champion's
                      # only non-DINO seat is the foreign raptor CoAtNet, which is in-sample and therefore
                      # unpriceable. coatnet_hybrid is a CoAtNet-2 conv/attention hybrid trained on OUR
                      # corpus under OUR objective — the first non-DINO seat this project can actually
                      # price. It prices at zero-to-negative. The architecture-diversity thesis is not
                      # refuted in general, but it is refused HERE, on the one instance we could measure.
                      # Its per-column shape is also the pool's own: MCL 0.715, Fracture 0.743, Lateral OA
                      # 0.782 are its three weakest, exactly the pool's weak three. A genuinely
                      # complementary trunk should have failed somewhere ELSE.
                      # RE-OPEN BY: a non-DINO member that is stronger SOLO (this one is 0.05 under the
                      # pool's best), or one whose weak columns are not MCL/Fracture/Lateral OA. Repeating
                      # the family at another size or LR only re-measures this row.

