                      # is the LEAST distinct thing priced this week - it is a near-twin of the pool, not
                      # a diversity seat, and the seat interval straddles zero rather than clearing it.
                      # IT WAS NEVER A SEAT CANDIDATE. It is the throughput arm, and on that question it
                      # succeeded: 142 s an epoch against 450 s for the same recipe at 336 px, measured on
                      # this card on 2026-09-05, for 0.0049 of solo AUC against band_dense 0.8578. A 3.2x
                      # cheaper recipe that costs half a point. That is what licenses running the label
                      # axis at exploratory cost - a 90-minute arm becomes 28 minutes - and it is recorded
                      # in experiments/README.md rather than here.
